{
  "name": "dsh-market-census",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Offline census of the DSH plugin market: load a cached awesome-dsh-plugin snapshot and get category/keyword counts, competitor search, near-duplicate scoring and new-arrival deltas. Read-only, deterministic, no network, no model. | 插件市场普查：读本地缓存的 awesome-dsh-plugin 快照，出类别/关键词统计、竞品检索、近似重复打分与新增统计；只读、确定性、不联网、不调模型。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "scripts/smoke.mjs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "SECURITY.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "plugin-market",
    "census",
    "competitor-analysis",
    "duplicate-check",
    "offline",
    "deterministic"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Daphne999",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Daphne999/dsh-market-census.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Daphne999/dsh-market-census#readme",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.15"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test --test-isolation=none test/*.test.mjs",
    "smoke": "node scripts/smoke.mjs",
    "check": "node --check lib/index.js"
  }
}
